+// calls *within* their own context (classic/persistent, ephemeral, worker),
+// but nothing serializes *across* contexts. ts_resource(0), php_embed_init(),
+// php_embed_shutdown() and ts_free_thread() all mutate the same process-wide
+// TSRM resource array — the boot gate above (wait_for_persistent_boot_settled)
